# Optional deployment override for src/data/enquiry.js's public endpoint.
# Example: https://formspree.io/f/your-form-id
# The receiving inbox is selected and verified in Formspree, not in this file.
# Leaving both endpoint settings empty keeps automatic sending disabled.
# Never put an API key here: Vite variables are included in the public site.
VITE_CONTACT_FORM_ENDPOINT=
